                      "key": "session_id",
                      "value": "<string>",
                      "description": "(Required) The session's unique identifier (UUID)"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Returns full detail for a single roleplay session, including score, rank, duration,\nand feedback.\n\nUse the `include` parameter to fetch optional heavy fields like the full conversation\ntranscript or evaluation criteria with grades. These are omitted by default to keep\nresponses lean."
